window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/comm-v28-144-27f7461e5aaf9e46.json"]={sha256:"27f7461e5aaf9e46e6c240aa4e90f7f73d0c03893cbbea513075394b6c7bd976",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v28-case-1348db92caa214bd","url":"https://www.itu.int/rec/T-REC-G.650.1-202401-I/en","title":"ITU-T G.650.1: Definitions and test methods for linear deterministic fibre attributes","titleEn":"ITU-T G.650.1: Definitions and test methods for linear deterministic fibre attributes","publisher":"ITU-T","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"comm-v28-144","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"comm-v28-144","related":[{"id":"comm-v28-145","referenceUrls":["https://www.itu.int/rec/T-REC-G.650.1-202401-I/en"],"title":"色散管理：雷射線寬與脈衝展寬","titleEn":"Dispersion management: laser linewidth and pulse broadening","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：由另一學徒只使用交付檔案重建兩情境與判定；需同時保留未通過情境。 教學熔接容許0.3 dB；名義0.2通過，變更0.4需復查；單向負值不作通過依據。 splice_pairs.csv與原始正反向跡線標記 保留輸入、逐項中間值、名義 0.2 與變更 0.4 dB、反例、驗收判定與模型限制，供另一學徒從零重算。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: A second apprentice must reconstruct both scenarios and decisions using only the handover files; retain failing cases as well. Teaching splice limit0.3 dB:0.2 passes and0.4 needs review; a negative one-way reading is not a pass criterion. splice_pairs.csv and original forward/reverse trace markers Preserve inputs, intermediate values, nominal 0.2 and changed 0.4 dB, counterexamples, acceptance decisions and model limits so another apprentice can reproduce them.","difference":"完成兩組條件的可重算判定，指出哪些觀察能區分原因。 教學延遲展寬上限200 ps；0.10 nm組可進下一測試，0.20 nm需縮頻或補償後再驗。","differenceEn":"Produce reproducible decisions for both configurations and identify observations that discriminate causes. Teaching spread limit200 ps: the0.10 nm case proceeds; the0.20 nm case requires narrower spectrum or compensation and re-test.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["合成A→B熔接0.8 dB、B→A為−0.4 dB；變更為0.9與−0.1 dB。 名義式 (0.8-0.4)/2 = 0.2 dB；變更式 (0.9-0.1)/2 = 0.4 dB。逐項標示量綱，先代入未四捨五入數值再作比較。 手算名義式並保存所有中間項，實作下列獨立驗證而非只抄最終數字： 反向座標換算到同一物理熔接，再平均；以穿透式損耗量測檢查總路徑，不能平均不對應事件。","合成D=17 ps/(nm km)、L=80 km，線寬0.10改0.20 nm，其他條件固定。 名義式 17*80*0.1 = 136 ps；變更式 17*80*0.2 = 272 ps。逐項標示量綱，先代入未四捨五入數值再作比較。 手算名義式並保存所有中間項，實作下列獨立驗證而非只抄最終數字： 分別計算兩端波長的群延遲差，核對D的正負與絕對展寬；將結果除位元時間但不據此宣稱BER。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Synthetic A-to-B splice0.8 dB and reverse−0.4 dB; changed readings0.9 and−0.1 dB. Nominal (0.8-0.4)/2 = 0.2 dB; changed (0.9-0.1)/2 = 0.4 dB. Label dimensions, substitute unrounded values and only then compare. Calculate the nominal expression with intermediate terms and implement this independent validation rather than copying the final number: Map reverse coordinates to the same physical splice before averaging; verify total insertion loss and never average different events.","Synthetic D=17 ps/(nm km), L=80 km, linewidth changed from0.10 to0.20 nm with other conditions fixed. Nominal 17*80*0.1 = 136 ps; changed 17*80*0.2 = 272 ps. Label dimensions, substitute unrounded values and only then compare. Calculate the nominal expression with intermediate terms and implement this independent validation rather than copying the final number: Calculate delays at both spectral edges, check the sign of D and absolute spread; normalize by bit time without claiming a BER.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"comm-v28-154","referenceUrls":["https://www.itu.int/rec/T-REC-G.709/en"],"title":"DP-16QAM：每符號位元與傳輸代價","titleEn":"DP-16QAM: bits per symbol and transport tradeoff","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：由另一學徒只使用交付檔案重建兩情境與判定；需同時保留未通過情境。 教學熔接容許0.3 dB；名義0.2通過，變更0.4需復查；單向負值不作通過依據。 splice_pairs.csv與原始正反向跡線標記 保留輸入、逐項中間值、名義 0.2 與變更 0.4 dB、反例、驗收判定與模型限制，供另一學徒從零重算。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: A second apprentice must reconstruct both scenarios and decisions using only the handover files; retain failing cases as well. Teaching splice limit0.3 dB:0.2 passes and0.4 needs review; a negative one-way reading is not a pass criterion. splice_pairs.csv and original forward/reverse trace markers Preserve inputs, intermediate values, nominal 0.2 and changed 0.4 dB, counterexamples, acceptance decisions and model limits so another apprentice can reproduce them.","difference":"完成兩組條件的可重算判定，指出哪些觀察能區分原因。 教學率目標200 Gbit/s只由16QAM達成；需另外提出所需SNR與非線性驗證，不能直接批准升階。","differenceEn":"Produce reproducible decisions for both configurations and identify observations that discriminate causes. Only16QAM reaches the200 Gbit/s teaching target; require separate SNR and nonlinearity checks before approving modulation change.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["合成A→B熔接0.8 dB、B→A為−0.4 dB；變更為0.9與−0.1 dB。 名義式 (0.8-0.4)/2 = 0.2 dB；變更式 (0.9-0.1)/2 = 0.4 dB。逐項標示量綱，先代入未四捨五入數值再作比較。 手算名義式並保存所有中間項，實作下列獨立驗證而非只抄最終數字： 反向座標換算到同一物理熔接，再平均；以穿透式損耗量測檢查總路徑，不能平均不對應事件。","合成32 GBd；比較M=4和M=16，兩偏振同速且不計框架開銷。 名義式 2*32*log2(4) = 128 Gbit/s；變更式 2*32*log2(16) = 256 Gbit/s。逐項標示量綱，先代入未四捨五入數值再作比較。 手算名義式並保存所有中間項，實作下列獨立驗證而非只抄最終數字： 列4與16點星座的位元標籤數；以每偏振每秒符號數獨立乘回，不把星座點數直接當位元數。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Synthetic A-to-B splice0.8 dB and reverse−0.4 dB; changed readings0.9 and−0.1 dB. Nominal (0.8-0.4)/2 = 0.2 dB; changed (0.9-0.1)/2 = 0.4 dB. Label dimensions, substitute unrounded values and only then compare. Calculate the nominal expression with intermediate terms and implement this independent validation rather than copying the final number: Map reverse coordinates to the same physical splice before averaging; verify total insertion loss and never average different events.","Synthetic32 GBd; compareM=4 andM=16 with equal polarization rates and no framing overhead. Nominal 2*32*log2(4) = 128 Gbit/s; changed 2*32*log2(16) = 256 Gbit/s. Label dimensions, substitute unrounded values and only then compare. Calculate the nominal expression with intermediate terms and implement this independent validation rather than copying the final number: Enumerate label lengths for4- and16-point constellations; multiply symbols per polarization independently, not constellation count itself.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v28-case-1348db92caa214bd","url":"https://www.itu.int/rec/T-REC-G.650.1-202401-I/en","title":"ITU-T G.650.1: Definitions and test methods for linear deterministic fibre attributes","titleEn":"ITU-T G.650.1: Definitions and test methods for linear deterministic fibre attributes","publisher":"ITU-T","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v28-case-941dfb38670077d1","url":"https://www.itu.int/rec/T-REC-G.709/en","title":"ITU-T G.709: Interfaces for the optical transport network","titleEn":"ITU-T G.709: Interfaces for the optical transport network","publisher":"ITU-T","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
